赵云（RE-CS-06）：允许 QCA4B 持久虚拟口承载 tagged PPPoE

QCA4B 数据路径已经把 WAN 用户口映射成持久 VP，PPE 的 PPPoE session 表也是按
VP 上的 session ID / peer 地址匹配的。如果同时又要求"物理口 + VLAN VSI"，
RE-CS-06 上所有带 VLAN tag 的 PPPoE 流量都会在安装硬件流表之前被拒，PPE
加速对 PPPoE 等于没生效。

这里保留物理 underlay 的 VLAN VSI 要求，但让 QCA4B 的 VP 直接承载 tagged PPPoE。

--- a/target/linux/qualcommbe/patches-6.18/0652-net-ethernet-qualcomm-ppe-manage-dsa-pppoe-flow-lifecycle.patch
+++ b/target/linux/qualcommbe/patches-6.18/0652-net-ethernet-qualcomm-ppe-manage-dsa-pppoe-flow-lifecycle.patch
@@ -604,16 +604,16 @@
 +	 * The caller already holds its flow's VP reference.
 +	 */
 +	if (vp >= 0) {
-+		/* VLAN-over-VP needs VP translation rules, not a physical rule. */
-+		if (session->svid >= 0 || session->cvid >= 0)
-+			return -EOPNOTSUPP;
++		/* QCA4B already owns the user-port identity in the VP; the
++		 * PPPoE session table matches SID and peer on that VP, so no
++		 * physical-port VLAN VSI is required for this tagged underlay. */
 +		ret = ppe_vp_ref_qca4b(ft->ppe_dev, vp, session->port);
 +		if (ret)
 +			return ret;
  	}
  
 -	return -ENOENT;
-+	if (session->svid >= 0 || session->cvid >= 0) {
++	if (vp < 0 && (session->svid >= 0 || session->cvid >= 0)) {
 +		vlan = ppe_ft_vlan_get(ft, session->port, session->svid,
 +				       session->cvid, session->vlan_mtu,
 +				       session->keep_svid,
